        },
        "valueString": "Patient denies fever, rigors, flank pain, nausea, vomiting, lower urinary tract symptoms, weight loss, night sweats, abdominal pain, change in bowel habit, back or flank pain, testicular lump, trauma, and sudden onset of severe testicular pain."
